<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA THIRD DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA V INDIA THIRD DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third day of</p>
